    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5e78d402_87f1a925",
        "filename": "core/java/android/net/IpSecConfig.java",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 292,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-06T01:55:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is there a reason why the check for \"can\u0027t use AEAD in combination with auth or enc\" is not in the same place as this check?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 292,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 292,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "74497dc1c50ff8b515219abf99aa668f79ba74cd",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "43f87f9e_7605166b",
        "filename": "core/java/android/net/IpSecConfig.java",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 292,
      "author": {
        "id": 1060151
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-06T02:16:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Actually, we need to ensure that this gets checked on the IpSecService() side of the equation as well... it\u0027s not good enough to simply do the validation on the write-to-parcel. The reason we have the other validation inside IpSecService is to avoid that problem. We *can* move at least some of that logic to IpSecConfig, but we still have to do any cross-validation inside IpSecService, so the more I think about it, the more I think we should move this validation into IpSecService where we already have a method to validate the config.",
      "parentUuid": "5e78d402_87f1a925",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 292,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 292,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "74497dc1c50ff8b515219abf99aa668f79ba74cd",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "00a3944a_22ca70d7",
        "filename": "core/java/android/net/IpSecConfig.java",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 292,
      "author": {
        "id": 1221725
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-12-21T01:10:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done; I think it\u0027s worth having all of that in the same place.\n\nContext: I was considering pulling the \"can\u0027t use AEAD in combination with auth or enc\" into this check, but then we would have two methods checking that the IpSecConfig is valid. It made sense to put it all in IpSecService.",
      "parentUuid": "43f87f9e_7605166b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 292,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 292,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "74497dc1c50ff8b515219abf99aa668f79ba74cd",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e0f5a90f_1ea67fbd",
        "filename": "tests/net/java/android/net/IpSecConfigTest.java",
